{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:20.62]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[00:34.40]Okay (Wheezy Beats)\n[00:46.02]Um, in her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[01:00.82]Hold on, what I say after that, I'ma fuckin' kill this shit\n[01:35.44]Um, in her mouth like a dentist, filling in, in\n[02:07.86]Okay\n[Verse]\n[02:08.94]In her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[02:12.20]I fuck her good, just to make her feel my sins\n[02:15.62]I pray to God, need him to forgive my sins\n[02:19.10]I go and get high, get low, then get high again\n[02:22.50]I'm in her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[02:25.90]I fuck her good, make her feel all my sins\n[02:29.32]I'm on my knees, need him to forgive my sins\n[02:32.76]I get high, get low, then get high again\n[02:38.46]Pop a pill so I could feel real for a second\n[02:42.32]Handy Manny tool, drill when I'm reckless\n[02:45.32]Sipping big lean like I was raised down in Tеxas\n[02:48.74]Bitch, I'm straight flexin'\n[02:50.50]Diamonds cowboys, heehawing on my necklace\n[02:54.02]I feel likе I'm reckless\n[02:55.60]Pull up with a TEC, to slam a nigga like some Tekken\n[02:58.72]I was sipping on the Tech, I get high in a couple seconds\n[03:02.46]Ballin' like Spalding and I don't really do no talkin'\n[03:06.04]I give her a D, and then I follow with the offense\n[03:08.88]She tell me my dick is awesome, but my attitude is awful\n[03:12.94]I feel like I'm Dahmer, get it? I'm a fuckin' monster\n[03:15.74]Nigga you don't want no problem\n[03:17.96]I work with them robbers, and them demons, and them goblins\n[03:21.42]AP on my wrist is really tick-tock shinin'\n[03:24.82]I feel like I'm Tony Hawk, big skate grindin'\n[03:28.16]Cowboy shit new revolver is shinin'\n[03:32.04]Yeah, I fuck your bitch and never ever land\n[03:35.92]I put the cannon on my wrist, I feel like Mega Man\n[03:39.70]The AK-47 import from Afghanistan\n[03:42.46]I feel like 50 Cent 'cause yes, I know that many men\n[03:46.42]They want to see me dead, they want to see one in my head\n[03:49.88]But I can't go for that, so I got niggas toting lead\n[03:53.32]And they won't go for that, you pull up, they leave you dead\n[03:56.76]Up at my show in fact, we had to knock him in his head\n[03:59.96]'Cause he was talkin' shit, I bet his mama called up feds\n[04:03.36]'Cause he's a walkin' lick, it's not my fault that he was there\n[04:07.04]And yeah, he had to get hit, I guess that nigga—\n[04:09.40]Ooh, I just killed that","words":[[20.62,21.04,"Yeah,"],[24.92,25.32,"yeah,"],[30.6,30.74,"yeah,"],[32.82,33.26,"yeah"],[34.4,35.44,"Okay"],[37.6,37.8,"(Wheezy"],[40.12,43.74,"Beats)"],[46.02,46.08,"Um,"],[47.0,47.04,"in"],[47.98,48.12,"her"],[48.76,49.02,"mouth"],[49.32,49.46,"like"],[50.68,50.68,"a"],[55.0,55.84,"dentist,"],[57.62,58.26,"filling"],[58.54,58.62,"in"],[60.82,61.08,"Hold"],[61.28,61.76,"on,"],[62.02,62.22,"what"],[63.32,63.32,"I"],[64.5,64.84,"say"],[65.44,65.64,"after"],[66.2,66.62,"that,"],[68.34,68.5,"I'ma"],[69.04,69.38,"fuckin'"],[75.28,75.46,"kill"],[81.28,81.44,"this"],[81.86,82.1,"shit"],[95.44,95.54,"Um,"],[115.22,115.28,"in"],[115.32,115.48,"her"],[115.6,115.94,"mouth"],[116.04,116.24,"like"],[116.3,116.3,"a"],[116.44,116.88,"dentist,"],[119.96,120.48,"filling"],[122.06,122.14,"in,"],[123.82,124.18,"in"],[127.86,128.24,"Okay"],[128.94,129.02,"In"],[129.08,129.18,"her"],[129.3,129.64,"mouth"],[129.74,129.92,"like"],[130.08,130.08,"a"],[130.16,130.5,"dentist,"],[130.58,131.04,"filling"],[131.54,131.74,"in"],[132.2,132.2,"I"],[132.3,132.52,"fuck"],[132.56,132.62,"her"],[132.76,133.06,"good,"],[133.16,133.34,"just"],[133.4,133.46,"to"],[133.58,133.78,"make"],[133.84,133.9,"her"],[134.0,134.2,"feel"],[134.32,134.62,"my"],[134.84,135.24,"sins"],[135.62,135.62,"I"],[135.7,135.9,"pray"],[135.98,136.04,"to"],[136.16,136.44,"God,"],[136.6,136.74,"need"],[136.78,136.9,"him"],[137.0,137.08,"to"],[137.24,137.68,"forgive"],[137.76,138.0,"my"],[138.32,138.7,"sins"],[139.1,139.1,"I"],[139.2,139.26,"go"],[139.32,139.36,"and"],[139.44,139.54,"get"],[139.62,